  "body": "THE LIFESTYLE\r\nThis iconic beachfront home captures everything people dream about when they picture life by the water. Positioned just moments from the shoreline in one of East Auckland's most tightly held coastal pockets, it places the ocean at the heart of your daily routine - whether you're watching the morning tide or unwinding at sunset from your own front yard.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that suits many lives: a family ready to embrace true beachside living, a couple seeking a relaxed and romantic coastal setting, a professional craving balance and inspiration while working from home, or an investor who recognises the enduring strength of a premium seaside address.\r\n\r\nTHE PROPERTY\r\nBuilt with the enduring character of its era, this three bedroom home sits on a valuable landholding with undeniable future upside. The fundamentals here are strong - solid construction, a proven location, and a position that has consistently outperformed over time.\r\n\r\nWhether you choose to enjoy it exactly as it is, renovate to your own vision, or landbank for the future - the bones are ready for whatever you bring to it.\r\n\r\nTHE LOCATION\r\nBeyond its immediate beachfront appeal, the location delivers on every front. Zoned for the highly sought-after Macleans College and just moments from Half Moon Bay Marina, local cafes, and everyday conveniences - this is an address that consistently delivers in both lifestyle and long term growth.\r\n\r\nOpportunities in streets like The Parade are increasingly rare, and tightly held for good reason. This is a prestigious coastal address for families entering a premium suburb, investors securing lasting value, or visionaries ready to unlock its next chapter.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n* 3 well proportioned bedrooms, serviced by a functional family bathroom\r\n* Classic character home with timeless appeal and solid, dependable construction\r\n* Positioned beachfront, offering an effortless coastal lifestyle\r\n* Exceptional renovation or add-value opportunity to modernise and capitalise\r\n* Located within the highly sought after Macleans College zone\r\n* Set in a tightly held, high-demand coastal suburb known for long-term growth and lifestyle appeal\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a property - it's an opportunity to secure a position in one of East Auckland's most tightly held beachfront locations, where lifestyle and long term value align. Whether you're drawn by the setting, the schooling, or the potential to create something truly special, opportunities like this are becoming increasingly rare. \r\n\r\nAct with confidence - this is coastal real estate at its most compelling, and it will be sold.\r\nContact Kevin or Renee today!",
